<h3><u>Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya<br>
(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<ol><li>Ter BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan </li><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Thookrain Khaati Hui Maqtal Mein Kion Aai Hai Tu </li><p>Mujh Ko Dikhlanay Tamanchon Kay Nishan Lai Hai Tu</p><p>Neend Say Aankhein Hai Bojhal Aa Meray Nazdeek Aa</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Jaanta Hoon Meray Senay Par Sada Soi Hai Tu</li><p>Teri Aankhein Keh Rahi Hain Kis Qadar Roi Hai Tu</p><p>Is Andheray Dasht Mein Kion Daiti Hai Mujh Ko Sada</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Aaj Ki Shab Maan(s.a.) Kay Paihloo Mein Hi Sona Tha Tumhain</li><p>Piyasay Bachon Aur Phuphi(s.a.) Sath Rehna Tha Tumhain</p><p>Aa Meray Teeron Bharay Seenay Peh Aakay Lait Jaa</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Hogai Hai Shaam Phir Bhi Garm Hai Saari Zamin</li><p>Daikh Teray Paoon Mein Chalay Na Parh Jaen Kahin</p><p>Kion Nikal Aai Hai Khaimay Say Barehna Pa Bata</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Sogaey Wehshi Darinday Tu Hai Ab Tak Jaagti</li><p>Phir Rahi Hai BaBa(a.s.) BaBa(a.s.) Kehti Meri Laadli</p><p>Main Yahan Aur Nehr Peh Betab Hotay Hain Chacha(a.s.)</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Aa Meri Aaghosh Mien Kuch Dair Aakay Lait Ja</li><p>Phir To Sooey Shaam Jaega Hamara Qafla(a.s.)</p><p>Teri Gardan Mein Rasan Bandhay Gi Yeh Fauj-e-Jafaa</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Tujh Ko Paidal Mujh Ko Naizay Par Safar Karna Hai Ab</li><p>Karbala Sar Hochuki Hai Shaam Sar Karan Hai Ab</p><p>Daikh Marqad Chorh Kay Maqtal Mein Aaen Syeda(s.a.)</p><p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p><p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p><li>Beh Raha Hai Khoon Kaanon Say Sakina Kis Qadar</li></ol>

<p>Askh Say Chehra Hai Bheega Khon Say Poshak Tar</p>
<p>Daikh Kar Tujh Ko Pukara Laasha-e-Besar Mera</p>
<p>Tera BaBa(a.s.) Sota Hai Yahan</p>
<p>(Ilayya Ilayya Ya Bunaiyya) x2</p></font></p>
